{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision counts.</strong> Each level presents a simple yet satisfying challenge: hit every tomato using a limited number of shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage contains 15 levels, starting with slow-moving and gradually increasing in speed and difficulty. As you progress, you'll encounter tomatoes of various sizes and distances, testing your aim and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play <strong>any</strong>\u00a0<strong>stage independently,\u00a0</strong>even if you haven't completed the previous ones. This give you freedom to explore other challenges.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stage 1</strong> features static tomatoes - learn how to play. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>Stage 2 onward</strong>, targets\u00a0move in different patterns, adding new layers of challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can <strong>reset your progress</strong> on any stage<strong> </strong>and replay it from the beginning, or jump into any level you've already unlocked.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918660?t=1756542677","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918660?t=1756542677","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918660/9dd57055892b09aeae4e36a5096fea405fba8fbd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756542677","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918660/9dd57055892b09aeae4e36a5096fea405fba8fbd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756542677","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{